                <h2 id="skills-title" class="h2" data-reveal>Skills your team writes down.</h2>
              </div>
              <p class="body head__aside" data-reveal>
                A skill tells an agent how your team does one job, such as proving checkout still works.
                Start one from a template, keep it in the wiki with the rest of what your team knows, and
                the agents in your projects use it.
              </p>
